### Test Maintenance API

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@vehicleId = 1
@maintenanceId = 1
@token = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9... (ajoute ton token ici)

### 📋 1️⃣ Liste toutes les maintenances
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicle-maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 🔍 2️⃣ Récupère maintenances du véhicule 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicle-maintenance/vehicle/{{vehicleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 🚨 3️⃣ Récupère les ALERTES (WARNING + CRITICAL)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicle-maintenance/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ➕ 4️⃣ AJOUTE une nouvelle maintenance
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/vehicle-maintenance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vehicleId": 1,
  "recordDate": "2026-04-17T14:30:00",
  "fuelLevel": 85,
  "engineCondition": 90,
  "tireCondition": 80,
  "brakeCondition": 95,
  "oilLevel": 88,
  "mileage": 5000,
  "kmSinceLastService": 1000,
  "daysSinceLastService": 10,
  "totalTransports": 25,
  "status": "GOOD",
  "notes": "Maintenance test - Véhicule en bon état",
  "resolved": false
}

###

